==Trivia==
This card's illustration rare print features {{p|Swinub}}, {{p|Piloswine}}, and {{p|Mamoswine}}.

===Origin===
*This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Plasma Storm|Mamoswine|28}} from the {{TCG|Plasma Storm}} expansion.
*{{a|Thick Fat}} is an [[Ability]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Mamoswine}} can have.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Sword}}.

